<title>FINLAND: PROTOS TRADES LARGE TAMRO STAKE IN-HOUSE.</title>
<headline>PROTOS TRADES LARGE TAMRO STAKE IN-HOUSE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler Oy Tamro Ab was boosted by a big in-house deal on Wednesday afternoon.</p>
<p>A total of 1.3 million Tamro shares worth almost 42 million markka in Tamro at an unchanged 32.00 markka per share were traded in-house by Protos Stockbrokers. Protos brokers declined to comment the deal.</p>
<p>A Tamro spokeswoman said she did not know who made the deal.</p>
<p>Tamro will release its January-August report on Thursday at 0900/0600 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
</text>
